     * I stays SET (nothing ever CLIs), and the 65C02 wakes from
     * WAI on the line WITHOUT vectoring - no handler, no vector
     * table entry, the native vectorless idiom. bw_now()'s poll
     * clears IFR6, which drops the line again. */
